     proj_folder          str    — proj_city_dashboard 或 proj_new_taipei_city_dashboard
     col_map              dict   — {col_name: pg_type}
     extract_imports      list   — e.g. ["get_data_taipei_api"] from utils.extract_stage
     extra_transform_imports  list — e.g. ["add_point_wkbgeometry_column_to_df"]
